                <br>
                <h2 style="text-align: center;"><b>Transcendence</b></h2>
                <p style="text-align: center;"><i>Cooper Phillips &amp; Rob Sullens</i></p>
                <br>
                <h2 style="text-align: center;"><b>The First I Love You</b></h2>
                <p style="text-align: center;"><i>Kyle Dixon &amp; Michael Stein</i></p>
            </div>

            <br>
            <br>

            <div class="carousel" data-delay="4000" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3;">
                <div class="esto-pic">
